        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "26838f43-aeb0-5865-b1a8-7bf7cb542793",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Capaldi, Jenna Coleman, Samuel Anderson, Paul King, Simon Farnaby, David Heyman\n- Roles: the Doctor, Malcolm Tucker, Mr. Curry, Danny Pink\n- Works: Doctor Who, The Thick of It, Paddington, Paddington 2, Into the Dalek\n- Awards: British Academy Television Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Capaldi was born on 14 April 1958 and is a Scottish actor, writer, and director.\n- Peter Capaldi is best known for playing the twelfth Doctor in Doctor Who and Malcolm Tucker in The Thick of It.\n- Peter Capaldi received four British Academy Television Award nominations for The Thick of It and won Best Male Comedy Performance in 2010.\n- Peter Capaldi played Mr. Curry, Paddington Bear's neighbour, in the film Paddington.\n- Peter Capaldi was set to reprise Mr. Curry in Paddington 2.\n- Paddington 2 is an upcoming British-French family-comedy film directed by Paul King, co-written by Paul King and Simon Farnaby, and produced by David Heyman.\n- Paddington 2 was set to be released on 10 November 2017.\n- Into the Dalek stars Peter Capaldi and Jenna Coleman and introduces Samuel Anderson as Danny Pink.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "014fcf71-4c44-5353-ab24-31409aec3acc",
